  emoji: '🌾',
  chapterText:
      'Poonam\'s father had farmed the same eleven acres of cotton land his own father once worked, and he had '
      'never once imagined his daughter pursuing anything beyond eventually marrying into a similar farming '
      'family. When Poonam announced, halfway through Class 8, that she intended to study agricultural science '
